        "span": "Once I have them",
        "type": "non_actionable_text",
        "requires_validation": false,
        "validation_scope": "—"
      },
      {
        "span": "I can check each product's rating (via `show_product`)",
        "type": "reasoning_conclusion",
        "requires_validation": false,
        "validation_scope": "—"
      },
      {
        "span": "and add the ones rated above 3.7 to your cart.",
